invfs (0.6.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * core: eliminate O(N^2) unlink bottleneck by scoping sibling cascade to parent directory with fast in-memory candidate filter (speeds up rm -rf from 2-4 files/s to 10000+ files/s).
  * core: enable lazy_reclaim=1 and raw_mirror=0 as default mount options.
  * core: dynamic sibling tag registration (invfs_register_sibling_tag) replacing format-specific hardcoded tags.
  * codecs: support dynamic sibling_tags declaration in .ivpack plugin manifests.
  * boot: smart hypervisor driver auto-detection (Hyper-V, KVM, VMware, bare metal) in mkinitcpio invfs_install.
  * boot: auto-resolve partition UUID and volume superblock UUID in invf-boot-setup and mkinitcpio invfs_hook.
  * packaging: auto-detect initramfs frameworks (mkinitcpio/dracut/initramfs-tools) and ensure invf-boot-setup is always installed.

 -- InvariantFS Developers <invfs@localhost>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0000

invfs (0.6.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * tools: add invf-boot-setup for automated UEFI GRUB installation on InvariantFS rootfs.
  * tools: support single-device and dual-device mirror boot configurations in invf-boot-setup.
  * bootstrap: verify SHA256 for distro packages only if entry exists in SHA256SUMS.

 -- InvariantFS Developers <invfs@localhost>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 21:25:00 +0000

invfs (0.6.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fuse: warn on stderr when root mounts without -o allow_other.
  * mount.invfs: warn when root mounts without -o allow_other.
  * mkinitcpio / dracut / initramfs-tools: enforce allow_other,survive_term for rootfs mounts.
  * packaging/bootstrap.sh: natively install distro packages (.pkg.tar.zst / .deb) via pacman/dpkg.
  * packaging/install.sh: install mkinitcpio hooks to /usr/lib/initcpio regardless of PREFIX.
  * Drop obsolete external optdepends/recommends (libjxl, p7zip).

 -- InvariantFS Developers <invfs@localhost>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 19:30:00 +0000

