invfs (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Meta-v3 cutover: B+-tree base + append-only delta metadata architecture.
  * Inode-id-keyed sweep publication and RAW data-block reclamation.
  * Native symlinks and special files (FIFO/SOCK/CHR/BLK with rdev).
  * Lock-free base reads with position-explicit pread/pwrite concurrency.
  * Hierarchical directory walk with full path resolution.
  * Full bit-exactness verification and automated CI test matrix.

 -- InvariantFS Developers <invfs@localhost>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

